<!--
  Every URL that is fit to be indexed: the home page, plus the case studies
  that are actually written.

  This list mirrors PUBLISHED_PROJECTS in src/content/work.ts. Publish a
  project there — remove its `draft: true` — and add the URL here in the same
  commit; a draft carries `noindex` from WorkDetail.tsx, and a URL that is both
  submitted in a sitemap and marked noindex is not a neutral mistake. Search
  Console reports it as an error and it costs trust in the rest of the file.

  The host is www and must match SITE_URL in src/content/profile.ts and the
  Sitemap line in robots.txt. The apex answers 307 to this host, so a sitemap
  on the apex would be a list of redirects.

  No <lastmod>: a date nobody maintains is worse than no date, because Google
  discounts every date in the file once it catches one that is wrong.
-->
